  "contentHtml": "<p><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">알아두면&#160;쓸데있는&#160;신기한&#160;과학선생님들의&#160;잡담시간! </span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">재과만&#160;톡톡은&#160;연수,&#160;발표형식이&#160;아닌 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">자유로운&#160;잡담으로&#160;이루어지는&#160;편안한&#160;시간을&#160;추구합니다. </span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">42번째&#160;&#39;재과만&#160;톡톡&#39;&#160;행사&#160;안내 </span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1.&#160;일시&#160;:&#160;2026.&#160;6.&#160;5(금)&#160;오후&#160;8시~&#160;9시30 </span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2.&#160;장소&#160;:&#160;ZOOM&#160; </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">Zoom 회의 참가 주소 미리 공개</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://us06web.zoom.us/j/2125427765?pwd=EFoMrBSidekEgUI4xh38lBqMIUMvET.1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://us06web.zoom.us/j/2125427765?pwd=EFoMrBSidekEgUI4xh38lBqMIUMvET.1</a></span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">회의&#160;ID:&#160;212&#160;542&#160;7765 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">암호:&#160;a1234 </span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3e4fbeb27dcbfa4237342cb146cde94b42e7eb5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3e4fbeb27dcbfa4237342cb146cde94b42e7eb5\" data-origin-width=\"1254\" data-origin-height=\"1254\"></div><p><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">3.&#160;주제&#160;:&#160;물질의&#160;구성(중학교&#160;2학년&#160;4단원&#160;) </span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2022&#160;개정교육과정에서&#160;중학교&#160;2학년&#160;물질의&#160;구성&#160;단원에&#160;다시&#160;주기율표가&#160;들어&#160;왔습니다. </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">너와&#160;내가&#160;같은&#160;원소로&#160;되어&#160;있다니?&#160; </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">지렁이도,&#160;책상도&#160;나랑&#160;같은&#160;원소로&#160;되어&#160;있다니?&#160;믿을&#160;수&#160;있나요? </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">도대체&#160;세상을&#160;구성하는&#160;물질은&#160;무엇으로&#160;되어&#160;있을까요? </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">또&#160;어떻게&#160;이런&#160;것들을&#160;알아냈을까요? </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">주기율표&#160;원소는&#160;몇번까지&#160;가능할까요? </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">결국&#160;원소를&#160;레고블럭&#160;처럼&#160;잘&#160;조립하면&#160;세상에&#160;없는&#160;새로운&#160;물질을&#160;만들어&#160;낼&#160;수&#160;있지는&#160;않을까요? </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">함께&#160;이야기&#160;나눠&#160;보아요. </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">중학교&#160;물질의&#160;구성과&#160;고등학교&#160;교과를&#160;연계해서&#160;요즘&#160;이슈가&#160;되고&#160;있는&#160;반도체&#160;내용도&#160;살짝&#160;발을&#160;담궈&#160;보려고&#160;합니다. </span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f212f46612d533b8735130c0e5a867aec8ad3f37\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f212f46612d533b8735130c0e5a867aec8ad3f37\" data-origin-width=\"1536\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">4.&#160;톡톡&#160;진행&#160;:&#160;재과만&#160;운영진 </span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">5.&#160;대상&#160;:&#160;물질이&#160;어떻게&#160;구성되어&#160;있는지&#160;궁금한&#160;과학선생님들 </span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">6.&#160;참가&#160;신청&#160;:&#160;공개된&#160;ZOOM&#160;주소에&#160;접속하는&#160;순서대로&#160;선착순&#160;100명 </span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">7.&#160;특전&#160;: </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;참여하시는&#160;선생님들께는&#160;수업시간에&#160;사용할&#160;수&#160;있는&#160;교과서&#160;관련&#160;가상&#160;실험과 </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;증강현실을&#160;이용하여&#160;재미있게&#160;맞출&#160;수&#160;있는&#160;주기율표&#160;맞추기&#160;프로그램을&#160;소개해&#160;드립니다.&#160;</span> <br><br></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uxHXuOJn0S8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uxHXuOJn0S8</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uxHXuOJn0S8\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"855\" data-video-height=\"481\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/KOQ3q/dJMb8WeGMwu/Yg376WoHkVeR529BF303C1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ft74x/dJMb8U80FgS/q0iC5IK2XY9xSpgTXM6nX0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/R1eNa/dJMb8WMwFsW/m5ODQoHtFbjrmRykeXwWJ1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"855\" data-video-origin-height=\"481\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uxHXuOJn0S8\" width=\"855\" height=\"481\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">행사&#160;관련&#160;Q&amp;A입니다.</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">------------------------------------------------------</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">Q&#160;:&#160;&#39;재과만&#160;톡톡&#39;이&#160;기존&#160;모임과&#160;뭐가&#160;다른가요?</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">A&#160;:&#160;진행자와&#160;초대&#160;손님이&#160;수업&#160;한&#160;단원이나&#160;다양한&#160;주제에&#160;대해서&#160;대화를&#160;나누는&#160;형식입니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;선생님들은&#160;접속해서&#160;본인&#160;얼굴이&#160;나올&#160;필요&#160;없습니다.&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;알쓸신잡&#160;형식을&#160;떠&#160;올리시면&#160;좋겠네요</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">Q&#160;:&#160;대화에&#160;참여도&#160;가능한가요?</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">A&#160;:&#160;채팅창으로&#160;궁금한&#160;것&#160;질문이나,&#160;참여&#160;가능합니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;중간에&#160;필요하면&#160;즉석에서&#160;초대손님으로&#160;참여할&#160;수도&#160;있습니다.</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">Q&#160;:&#160;줌에서는&#160;모든&#160;선생님들&#160;얼굴이&#160;다&#160;나오지&#160;않나요?</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">A&#160;:&#160;포커스&#160;모드를&#160;사용하기&#160;때문에&#160;선생님들은&#160;유튜브&#160;라이브&#160;방송&#160;보듯이&#160;하고,</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;대화하는&#160;선생님&#160;몇&#160;분만&#160;화면에&#160;보이게&#160;됩니다.&#160;부담&#160;없이&#160;들어오시면&#160;되요.</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">Q&#160;:&#160;참여하면&#160;무얼&#160;얻어갈&#160;수&#160;있을까요?</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">A&#160;:&#160;수업&#160;아이디어,&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;재과만&#160;카페에&#160;올라와&#160;있는&#160;실험에&#160;대한&#160;부연&#160;설명</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;재과만에&#160;올라와&#160;있는&#160;질문</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;그리고&#160;즉석에서&#160;질문과&#160;답변등을&#160;통해</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;수업에&#160;대한&#160;다양한&#160;아이디어를&#160;얻을&#160;수&#160;있습니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">Q&#160;:&#160;미리&#160;신청해야&#160;하나요?</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">A&#160;:&#160;유튜브&#160;라이브&#160;방송처럼&#160;그날&#160;공개된&#160;zoom&#160;주소로&#160;그냥&#160;들어오시면&#160;됩니다.&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;단&#160;100명이&#160;넘어가면&#160;늦게&#160;오시는&#160;분은&#160;접속이&#160;안될&#160;수&#160;있습니다.</span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">Q&#160;:&#160;한번만&#160;하나요?</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">A&#160;:&#160;잘&#160;되면&#160;한달에&#160;1번씩&#160;다양한&#160;주제를&#160;가지고&#160;진행할&#160;예정입니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;가능하면&#160;다음&#160;달에&#160;써먹을&#160;수&#160;있는&#160;단원&#160;내용을&#160;가지고&#160;진행할&#160;예정입니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}